<title>USA: Executone cancels proposed reverse split.</title>
<headline>Executone cancels proposed reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>MILFORD, Conn. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EXECUTONE Information Systems Inc said its board has decided not to propose and recommend to shareholders the one-for-three reverse stock split that it previously announced on February 20, 1997.</p>
<p>The decision is based on a several factors including the company's stock price, response from some major shareholders, and market volatility in &quot;small cap&quot; stocks, it said.</p>
</text>
